<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
   之 AA：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>编排与身份</span>，Agent 应用架构长什么样
     </Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
   传统调用链是 A 调B；Agent 应用是调度者决定下一个是谁、以及以谁的身份去调
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 8, height: 479, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
      {/* 编排四角色 */}
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '10px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginBottom: 6 }}>编排面上必须显式定义的四个角色</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, flex: 1 }}>
     {[
   { n: '入口', t: 'Router', d: '接住用户意图，判断该交给谁。不做业务判断，只做分诊。', c: '#FA4F24' },
 { n: '调度', t: 'Supervisor', d: '团队内分工、决定顺序、决定是否重来。不直接干业务。', c: '#F87D2F' },
  { n: '执行', t: 'Worker', d: '专业执行者，只做一类任务，可被并行派发。', c: '#E0651A' },
 { n: '兜底', t: 'Human Gate', d: '人在关键节点接手，有明确的进入条件与交付物。', c: '#0F1423' },
       ].map((it, i) => (
        <Box key={it.n} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 3, borderTop: '3px solid ' + it.c, padding: '7px 10px' }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8A8F99' }}>{it.n}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.c, marginTop: 1 }}>{it.t}</Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#5A6072', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{it.d}</Text>
          </Box>
     ))}
    </Box>
      </Box>

  {/* 身份传递链 */}
      <Box style={{ height: 116, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 4, padding: '10px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
 <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>身份传递链：权限必须跟着人走，不能停在 Agent 这一层</Text>
   <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, marginTop: 8, flex: 1 }}>
     {[
      { t: '最终用户', s: '张三 · 华东区采购经理', c: '#FA4F24' },
  { t: 'Agent 代理', s: '以张三身份运行', c: '#F87D2F' },
  { t: '数据集', s: '只可见张三有权数据', c: '#FBA15C' },
    { t: '检索索引', s: '过滤后切片', c: '#8A8F99' },
  { t: 'Action', s: '权限与张三一致', c: '#5A6072' },
     ].map((x, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', flex: 1, gap: 6 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 46, borderRadius: 3, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)', borderLeft: '3px solid ' + x.c, padding: '6px 10px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{x.t}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.62)', marginTop: 2 }}>{x.s}</Text>
          </Box>
   {i < 4 ? <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.4)' }}>→</Text> : null}
    </Box>
     ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>

      {/* 三条硬规则 */}
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
        {[
      { t: '状态契约先于调用', d: 'Agent 之间传递必须是结构化对象，不能是自然语言。', c: '#FA4F24' },
    { t: '职责不重叠', d: '两个 Agent 不允许同时对同一对象有写权限，否则归属不清。', c: '#F87D2F' },
     { t: '每条轨迹可追', d: '一次任务全程留痕，能回答谁调的、调了什么、结果如何。', c: '#0F1423' },
    ].map((it, i) => (
      <Box key={it.t} style={{ flex: 1, background: it.c, borderRadius: 4, padding: '10px 14px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{it.t}</Text>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.86)', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{it.d}</Text>
     </Box>
      ))}
</Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 12 }}>硕磐机密 · Agent智能体咨询方法论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 'auto' }}>21 / 30</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
